<http://data.silknow.org/object/0eb0b1a3-557e-3453-823c-2d00c1a7307f/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "The ground is woven with narrow strips of silver. The design of undulating ribbons and bunches of flowers, is woven with red, pink, violet, white, green, black and blue silk, brown, violet and white chenille, and silver and gold. Joined to each end are pieces of white brocade with a design of sprays of small flowers and large leaves woven with colored silks and metal. Trimmed with silver and gold gimp and lined with gray silk."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/0eb0b1a3-557e-3453-823c-2d00c1a7307f> .

<http://data.silknow.org/object/0eb0b1a3-557e-3453-823c-2d00c1a7307f>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "The ground is woven with narrow strips of silver. The design of undulating ribbons and bunches of flowers, is woven with red, pink, violet, white, green, black and blue silk, brown, violet and white chenille, and silver and gold. Joined to each end are pieces of white brocade with a design of sprays of small flowers and large leaves woven with colored silks and metal. Trimmed with silver and gold gimp and lined with gray silk."@en ;
